---
/** The book mark: a plane's axes and the canonical vector v = (3, 2). Decorative; the brand text names the link. */
---
<svg class="mark" viewBox="0 0 28 28" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
  <path class="mark-axes" d="M5 3v20h20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
  <path class="mark-leg" d="M5 23h13" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
  <path class="mark-vec" d="M5 23 L18 11" fill="none" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
  <path class="mark-head" d="M20.5 8.7 L14.6 10.6 L18.9 14.9 Z"/>
</svg>
